# College Mini Project Report Template

## Title
Student Performance Analysis Using Python and Exploratory Data Analysis

## Abstract
This project analyzes a public student performance dataset using Python. The analysis includes data inspection, data-quality checks, descriptive statistics, and visualizations. The aim is to explore associations between study-time category, absences, past failures, previous grades, and final mathematics grade.

